OL,5,G0030 Through the Night
OL,6,     FMonteverdi motets and madrigals
OL,7,     Fperformed by La Venexiana under
OL,8,     Ftheir artistic director Gabriele
OL,9,     FPalomba at the St. Gallen Festival
OL,10,     Fin Switzerland.
OL,11,G0630 Breakfast
OL,12,     FAl Ryan presents Radio 3's
OL,13,     FBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,14,     Femail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
